approaches.\n\nFigure FIGREF25 (bottom) shows the resulting plots.\n\nAgain, the same positivation peaks become apparent.\n\nBoth findings are consistent with the previous work mentioned and with our findings from ZuCo 1.0.\n\nThis is the first dataset that allows for the comparison between these two reading paradigms.\n\nWe described the materials and experiment\n\ndesign in detail and conducted an extensive validation to ensure the quality of the recorded data.",
